<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-009" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:read" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:read:m0000" ref="326_faf_cd3_B">王子猷</persName>、<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:read:m0004" ref="sm1_jfi_7k2">子敬</persName>兄弟共賞高士傳人及贊。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:read:m0017" ref="sm1_jfi_7k2">子敬</persName>賞<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:read:m0020" ref="gu3_xj1_9ny">井丹</persName>高潔，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:read:m0025" ref="326_faf_cd3_B">子猷</persName>云：「未若<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:read:m0032" ref="usb_lgr_ksa">長卿</persName>慢世。」</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:changqing" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:changqing:m0000" ref="usb_lgr_ksa">司馬相如</persName>者，蜀郡成都人，字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:changqing:m0013" ref="usb_lgr_ksa">長卿</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:uncle" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:uncle:m0000" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AAF">桓玄</persName>為太傅，大會，朝臣畢集。坐裁竟，問<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:uncle:m0019" ref="326_faf_cd3_BA">王楨之</persName>曰：「我何如卿第七叔？」</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:wangshipu" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:wangshipu:m0000" ref="326_faf_cd3_BA">楨之</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:wangshipu:m0003" ref="326_faf_cd3_BA">公榦</persName>，琅邪人，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:wangshipu:m0010" ref="326_faf_cd3_B">徽之</persName>子。歷侍中、大司馬長史。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:liunote" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note">第七叔，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:liunote:m0004" ref="sm1_jfi_7k2">獻之</persName>也。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:cao" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:cao:m0000" ref="326_faf_cd3_C">操之</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:cao:m0003" ref="326_faf_cd3_C">子重</persName>，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-009-wang080-short:cao:m0006" ref="326_faf_cd3">羲之</persName>第六子。歷秘書監、侍中、尚書、豫章太守。</p>
</text>
